## Visual concept used

A landscape, black-ground engineering instrument that makes the article's three load-bearing ideas geometric. A thin bright finishing layer rides on a **huge ghosted, already-built physique block** ("BUILT BY THE ANABOLICS — this drawer only REVEALS & SHARPENS it"), so the *margin-on-the-margin* humility is a proportion, not a caption. Three nesting tier columns — **TIER 1 LIGHT (unlocked/teal) → TIER 2 MEDIUM (+ Tier 1) → TIER 3 HEAVY (+ all below)** — are governed at the foot by a **BODY-FAT GOVERNOR DIAL** with locked pins on the higher detents, a law plate (`THE TIER IS SET BY YOUR BODY FAT, NOT YOUR IMPATIENCE`) and a step-down **return pawl** (`marker turns → step DOWN a tier`); an ascending **accelerator ramp** at the bottom shows the lever cleared only to Tier 1, Tier 2/3 LOCKED, and the path sealed past Tier 3.

Every compound is the repeated **direct→indirect transducer chip**: a tiny mechanism input port (`β2 agonist`, `PPAR-δ`, `ghrelin agonist`, `PDE5`, `α2 antagonist`, `ERR agonist`, …) → small direct effect → a **dominant lit INDIRECT-EFFECT output plate** (the reason you actually run it), with amber caveats bottom-left and goal-rail tags bottom-right. A vertical **cardiovascular-cost axis** + warm/cool tint strips put the CNS-flogging stimulants (clen, ephedrine, T3) **HIGH** and the under-the-CNS mitochondrial/glucose layer (methylene blue, SLU-PP-332, MOTS-c, glucose "+" combo) **LOW**. A **span-phase & adjunct lane** carries the dual-use efficient picks (MK-677, tadalafil) feeding two goal rails each, plus the MELANOTAN-2 stage tile and the amber CYTOLIN UGL-blend warning. Five **GOAL RAILS** up top (LEAN-OUT · FULLNESS · ENDURANCE · DRYNESS/VASCULARITY · INSULIN SENS.) + a non-anabolic-strength side-tap encode "read by goal, not by drug."

**The single red object** is the sealed **CONTEST-DIURETIC REDLINE KILL-ZONE** past the top of the ramp, behind a padlocked dashed barrier, drawn with a **NO DOSE MARKS — on purpose** plate (every other tool has dose context; the absence is the argument). Footer holds the base course: `PROTECTION & MONITORING MATTER MORE HERE, NOT LESS` and `IT REVEALS, IT DOESN'T BUILD — most of the year, most people need NONE of it`, with the forward-link chip to 4.4 Electrolyte Management. Headline: **"It doesn't build. It reveals."**

## Color discipline (§5 honored)

- **lit/teal** = the indirect output plates you read (the visual subject) + unlocked detents + dual-use picks
- **amber** = everything cautionary-but-not-fatal (stimulant cardiac caveats, MAOI/melanoma/appetite flags, Cytolin UGL warning, locked detents, return pawl, HIGH cost zone) — deliberately a lot of amber
- **one red object** = ONLY the contest-diuretic redline kill-zone
- **ghosted graphite** = the enormous already-built base block (present, structural, un-lit)
- warm tint = high-CV chips, cool tint = low-CV chips (cost reads pre-verbally)

## §7 avoidances respected

No shredded-abs/fat-burner-advert hero; not a re-typeset of the article's two tables (adds the mechanism→indirect transducers, cost-axis height, gated climbing detents, ghosted-base proportion the prose can't); no "best fat-burner" podium/ranking (lit = the indirect output, not "best"); body fat **does** gate the ramp (governor interlock + locked detents + step-down pawl unmissable); cautions are **not** red-flooded (only contest diuretics red); the contest diuretic carries **no dose/tick/calibration** (sealed, `NO DOSES — on purpose`); the finishing sliver does **not** rival the base — the ghosted block dwarfs it.

